counters the land's emperor, Hotohori, who believes Miaka is the foretold priestess of the kingdom's protector god Suzaku. By gathering the god's seven Celestial Warriors, the priestess can summon Suzaku and have all her wishes granted. Hotohori hopes this will save his country, and since it appears to be a fitting solution to the girl's problems as well, he convinces her to accept the role.\n\nMeanwhile, at the library, Yui realizes she has been brought back alone. Unable to intervene, she helplessly witnesses Miaka traversing through courageous trials as the mysterious book's heroine.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"War","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Harem","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":75,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ancient China","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":66,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Crime","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Rape","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Nudity","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Dragons","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":57,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Twins","rank":46,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Suicide","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Demons","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Fushigi Yugi: The Mysterious Play","english":"Fushigi Yugi